#EXTM3U
# ============================================================================
# FIXTURE SINTETICO — NO son datos medidos de ningun proveedor.
# Dominio `.invalid` (RFC 6761). Credenciales ya enmascaradas.
# Caso: master que YA declara #EXT-X-MEDIA TYPE=AUDIO con URI= (proveedor demuxed).
#   Esperado: exit 0; el generador reescribe GROUP-ID, anade AUDIO=, reescribe CODECS
#   (video real del STREAM-INF + codecs del grupo) y elimina los caps de video.
#   La rendition de 2 canales es el respaldo estereo (aud_st): ahi SI se permite bajar.
# ============================================================================
#EXT-X-VERSION:9
#EXT-X-INDEPENDENT-SEGMENTS
#EXT-X-MEDIA:TYPE=AUDIO,GROUP-ID="aud_src",NAME="EAC3 5.1",LANGUAGE="spa",CHANNELS="6",DEFAULT=YES,AUTOSELECT=YES,CODECS="ec-3",URI="https://fx.invalid/audio/***/***/1001_es_eac3.m3u8"
#EXT-X-MEDIA:TYPE=AUDIO,GROUP-ID="aud_src",NAME="AAC estereo",LANGUAGE="spa",CHANNELS="2",DEFAULT=NO,AUTOSELECT=YES,CODECS="mp4a.40.2",URI="https://fx.invalid/audio/***/***/1001_es_stereo.m3u8"
#EXTVLCOPT:network-caching=55000
#EXTVLCOPT:adaptive-maxbitrate=8000000
#EXTVLCOPT:video-width=1280
#EXTVLCOPT:video-height=720
#KODIPROP:inputstream.adaptive.max_resolution=1920x1080
#KODIPROP:inputstream.adaptive.max_bitrate=8000000
#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=9000000,AVERAGE-BANDWIDTH=6500000,RESOLUTION=3840x2160,FRAME-RATE=30.000,CODECS="hvc1.2.4.L153.B0,ec-3",VIDEO-RANGE=PQ,STABLE-VARIANT-ID="fx_P4"
https://fx.invalid/live/***/***/1001.m3u8
